# Pairs with ListedInSink. The pass dooms an id a capture is publishing:
# its listing still names the old row, so it removes the row the republish
# is about to refresh and then deletes the manifest the republish wrote,
# after the republish has registered it again.
MODULE: ListedInSinkPassDoomsPublishing
TARGET: ListedInSink
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the pass dooms an id a capture is publishing
PERTURBS: PruneList

--- FIND
       IN /\ D \ Busy # {}
          /\ prPh' = [prPh EXCEPT ![p] = "rows"]
          /\ prDoomed' = [prDoomed EXCEPT ![p] = D \ Busy]
--- REPLACE
       \* MUTATION: an id being published can be doomed.
       IN /\ D # {}
          /\ prPh' = [prPh EXCEPT ![p] = "rows"]
          /\ prDoomed' = [prDoomed EXCEPT ![p] = D]
--- END
